    {
      "id": "a63e1dcb-7e15-487a-a6be-804b30bd264a",
      "name": "Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -224,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 680,
        "content": "# 📞 Placetel AI Voice Agent → HubSpot CRM\n\nAI phone assistant that runs HubSpot actions during a call: identify callers, create contacts, create/look up tickets, log callbacks & call notes. ONE webhook → a Switch router branches on the `operation` field into 6 paths. Each response returns a `speech` field the agent reads aloud. Native HubSpot nodes only.\n\n## Setup\n1. **HubSpot credential** in n8n, selected on all HubSpot nodes (preset to OAuth2; App Token also works). Scopes: contacts + tickets (read/write), companies (read), Tasks/Notes write.\n2. **Activate** the workflow → copy the URL `https://<YOUR-N8N-DOMAIN>/webhook/placetel-ai/agent`.\n3. In **Placetel AI**, create ONE function (POST → that URL) using the JSON below; have the agent read the `speech` field aloud.\n\n## Notes\n- **Control field = `operation`** (do not name it `action` — Placetel drops that reserved field). Values: check_customer, create_contact, create_callback, ticket_status, create_ticket, log_call.\n- **Caller ID:** pass the real number via a prompt variable or request header (do not put an example in the field description, or the model sends '+49').\n- **Phone search** uses HubSpot's calculated phone fields (normalized national number).\n- **Tickets:** pipeline/stage default `0`/`1` (override via body); a per-caller ticket list is not possible natively → lookup by number only. **Engagements** use the legacy API.\n- **GDPR:** store transcripts only with consent."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c42c7d46-b284-4511-9614-b3788987bb99",
      "name": "Placetel AI function call (JSON)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -224,
        1088
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 708,
        "height": 1380,
        "content": "## Placetel AI function call\n\nPaste this JSON into the Placetel AI function editor. The operation is selected via the `operation` field.\n\n{\n  \"type\": \"function\",\n  \"name\": \"hubspot_crm\",\n  \"description\": \"Central interface to HubSpot CRM for phone requests. Choose the operation via 'operation' and fill only the fields needed. check_customer: check if the caller is an existing customer (needs phone; optional email). create_contact: create a contact (needs first_name, last_name, phone; optional email, company). create_callback: record a callback as a task (needs phone; optional name, reason, preferred_time). ticket_status: look up a ticket by number (needs ticket_id). create_ticket: create a ticket linked to the caller (needs subject, description; optional phone, email, priority). log_call: save a call note on the contact (needs summary; optional phone, intent, outcome, transcript).\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"operation\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"check_customer\",\"create_contact\",\"create_callback\",\"ticket_status\",\"create_ticket\",\"log_call\"], \"description\": \"The operation to run.\" },\n      \"phone\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Caller phone number, international (+49...). Use the transmitted caller ID.\" },\n      \"email\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Caller email, if provided.\" },\n      \"first_name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"First name. Required for operation=create_contact.\" },\n      \"last_name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Last name. Required for operation=create_contact.\" },\n      \"company\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Company name. Optional for create_contact.\" },\n      \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Caller name. Optional for create_callback.\" },\n      \"reason\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Callback reason. Optional for create_callback.\" },\n      \"preferred_time\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Preferred callback time (free text). Optional for create_callback.\" },\n      \"ticket_id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Ticket number (digits only). Required for ticket_status.\" },\n      \"subject\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Short subject. Required for create_ticket.\" },\n      \"description\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Detailed description. Required for create_ticket.\" },\n      \"priority\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"LOW\",\"MEDIUM\",\"HIGH\"], \"description\": \"Priority. Optional for create_ticket.\" },\n      \"summary\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Call summary. Required for log_call.\" },\n      \"intent\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Caller intent. Optional for log_call.\" },\n      \"outcome\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Call outcome. Optional for log_call.\" },\n      \"transcript\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Full transcript. Optional for log_call.\" }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"operation\"]\n  }\n}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
